# Site ID for the Perfox "Dashboard Insights" agent's Web Chat widget.
# Get it from that agent's Web Chat trigger > Embed tab in Perfox Studio,
# after the agent has been wired up there (see PERFOX_API_GUIDE.md).
# Leave unset to keep the widget off - ChatWidget renders nothing without it.
# VITE_PERFOX_SITE_ID=sa_site_live_...
